  "description": "Dependency-free high-performance .NET unit conversion library with 150 physical and engineering families, direct numeric APIs, strongly typed quantities, exact decimal/rational conversion, span parsing/formatting, dynamic and composite conversion, custom units, metadata, localization, and arbitrary-scale numbers.",
