  "readmeFile": "README.NUGET.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.1: 150 conversion families and 1,858 unit entries; catalog-wide strongly typed quantities and dimensional arithmetic; exact decimal/rational conversion; allocation-free span parsing/formatting for typed quantities; optimized dynamic detection and composite expressions; runtime custom units; integrated arbitrary-scale number conversion; System.Text.Json companion support; NativeAOT validation; definition-driven culture-aware unit display/parse localization; culture-consistent typed/span parsing and named quantity formatting; completed inverse dimensional arithmetic; culture-symmetric dynamic detection; immutable/indexed runtime metadata; hardened exact and arbitrary-scale input contracts; XML IntelliSense docs; symmetric catalog lookups; tightened public result/TryConvert contracts; public API compatibility gate; catalog-wide mathematical conformance and parser abuse guards; expanded Dutch localization coverage; multi-TFM clean consumer verification; optional analyzer guidance package; Apache-2.0 with Commons Clause v1.0 licensing.",
